cc-mod-academic-harness
=======================

A Claude Code mod that runs the Academic Harness research tooling inside Claude
Code. It started as a port of Academic Harness, which is the same author's
project, and since 0.6.0 it holds that source itself (core/): it no longer
downloads anything from the Academic Harness repository, and nothing follows it.

Code written for this mod (hooks/, server/, scripts/, tests/, types/, docs/, the
generated agents/ and the build tooling) is under the MIT License in LICENSE.

core/: Academic Harness, and what it bundles
--------------------------------------------

core/ is Academic Harness at version 0.54.1 (commit
a3f17eb8ae15221adeaa45cd19918c1f82f82973 of
https://github.com/raktim-mondol/academic-harness), MIT License, Copyright (c)
2026 Academic Harness (formerly ResearchCraft): its tool modules, writing
engine, PaperMemory, prompt and 791 skills. core/NOTICE is that project's own
notice and lists the third-party skill catalogues it bundles.

