Of the 791 skills in core/skills: 634 name MIT, 41 name BSD or Apache-2.0, 8 name
CC-BY-4.0, and 77 name nothing (they are Academic Harness's own text). The rest
need attention. To keep the six non-commercial skills out of what the plugin
serves, set AH_EXCLUDE_NONCOMMERCIAL=1 in the environment of Claude Code: the
skill search then covers 785 skills, and loading one of the six is refused
(the build already leaves them out of skills/).

