What is copied into this repository
-----------------------------------

skills/ and agents/ are generated from core/ by scripts/build-skills.mjs
and scripts/build-agents.mjs. The build leaves out every skill whose licence is
non-commercial, GPL or unknown (decision D5), and records what it copied and
what it left out, with each licence, in skills/.build-info.json. Of the 58
skills copied, 36 name MIT, 3 name CC-BY-4.0, and 19 name no licence because
they are the source's own text. Most are first-party Academic Harness skills
(MIT). The ones that come from other projects, and what each needs, are:

